stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> active: registered
  active --> degraded: consecutive failures over threshold
  degraded --> active: a successful acquire
  active --> unavailable: structurally inaccessible, e.g. login required
  unavailable --> active: access restored
  degraded --> retired: operator decision
  unavailable --> retired: operator decision
  active --> retired: operator decision
  retired --> [*]
